00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:54.350
And that data is actually
being created everywhere.

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:57.800
It's being created in
data centers on premises,

00:14:57.800 --> 00:14:59.930
it's being created at the edge.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.830
You need to package that data.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:05.510
You need to bring that data
to where you can process it.

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:08.370
After you process it
