them for predictions

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.930
and for finding out what this
machine learning thing can

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:20.950
really do for you in practice.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:24.830
Elastifile is just
that platform that

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:28.910
matches those needs of the
data for these machine learning

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:30.440
environments.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:33.140
We provide data mobility
to bring the data

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:34.520
to where it's needed.

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:38.300
We provide shareability so
that the applications creating

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:42.590
the data on-prem can use
the same data platform

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:45.800
that Kubeflow and
TensorFlow in general

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:48.800
uses to process that data.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.430
We provide usability to make
this all simple for the end

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:57.110
user and we provide scalability
so you can do that training

00:15:57.110 --> 00:16:00.710
and you can process that
data as fast as you can.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:04.250
And obviously, in the
